              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uz’ ujishe igihuzu co gukingīra, ukijishe mu nyuzi z’ amasufe no mu z’amashigisha no mu zisa n’agahama, no mu zera derere nziza zihinzwe neza; kize kijishwekw ibishushanyo vy’abakerubi, bijishwe n’abahinga bavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uz’ ukimanike ku misumari yacuzwe mw izahabu, iri ku nkingi zine zabājwe mu giti c’ umushita zometswekw izahabu, zineze mu bitereko bine vy’ifeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
