              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wongere ujishe n’igihuzu co gukinga ku muryango w’ihema, mu nyuzi z’amasufe no mu z’amashigisha no mu zisa n’agahama, no mu zera derere nziza zihinzwe neza, kijererenzwekw amabara n’ abahinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uz’ ubāze inkingi zitanu mu giti c’umushita z’ico gihuzu co gukinga, uzomekekw izahabu: imisumari yo kuri zo icurwe mw izahabu nyene; kand’ uz’ uvugutire imiringa, uyikūremw’ ibitereko bitanu vyo kunegamw’ izo nkingi.",
          "type": "text",
